icy/2026/10/26/canada-opens-consultation-on-draft-stablecoin-rules-maintains-ban-on-yields\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Canada opens consultation on draft stablecoin rules, maintains ban on yields</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
